  "designBoundaries": [
    "Visual root offsets follow the posed lower surface in both directions; no delayed half-metre hover.",
    "Airborne correction blends spatially across the last 0.8 m of reachable support, meets the actual root bounce at 2.5 cm clearance, and corrects penetration. Missing, overhead, steep, or distant supports do not alter the pose.",
    "An anchored recovery departing support releases its visual anchor while rising; actual rebound contacts still receive full floor correction.",
    "Collision position, axes, velocity, impact count and recovery timing match the uncorrected simulation across all 30 seeded cases. Cosmetic randomness does not steer gameplay.",
    "The optimization caches one mesh hint and a reusable ordered visible-mesh list from the preceding bounds pass. It does not cache pose distances, add world queries, or run exact skin scans. Unmeasured support traverses current visibility; contact-point callers retain traversal tie order."
  ],
